OL,3,GNEWSAThousands sign petition to save
OL,4,A#1.8m cinema refurb
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 4,000 people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition to save a project to redevelop
OL,8,Fa community cinema.
OL,10,FLast week, Reform-led Barnsley Council
OL,11,Fdecided to pull funding for works at
OL,12,FPenistone Town Hall, which is home to
OL,13,FPenistone Paramount cinema.
OL,15,FCouncil leader William Brown said the
OL,16,Fauthority would continue to work with
OL,17,Fpartners to "find the best way forward"
OL,18,Ffor the town.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
