OL,3,GNEWSAThousands sign petition to save
OL,4,A#1.8m cinema refurb
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarie Tidball, Labour MP for Penistone
OL,7,Fand Stocksbridge, has since set up a
OL,8,Fpetition to reverse the decision, which
OL,9,Fshe said was indefensible and
OL,10,Fundermined the building.
